    "raw_reply": "Sanjay Malhotra is the Governor of the Reserve Bank of India (RBI), the closest equivalent to a CEO or country head.  \nRBI is a statutory public institution and does not use corporate titles like MD, CEO, Country Head, or Marketing Head.  \nShri Rohit P. Das is Chief General Manager-in-Charge of the Department of Information Technology (equivalent to CTO); his public email is cgmincditco@rbi.org.in.  \nShri Rohit Jain is the Deputy Governor overseeing the Department of Information Technology and FinTech; his public administrative email is dgscm@rbi.org.in.  \nDevraj Sanyal handles AI-driven strategy and fraud mitigation at the Reserve Bank Innovation Hub (RBIH).  \nSanthosh George is CEO of Reserve Bank Information Technology (ReBIT), leading engineering, digital transformation, and cybersecurity.",
